OL,3,GNEWSA'I made race history - and
OL,4,Acelebrated with potato'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA runner has made history by becoming
OL,7,Fthe first woman to win Guernsey's
OL,8,Fannual Donkey Drop Out - notching up a
OL,9,Fdistance of more than 100 miles before
OL,10,Fcelebrating with her granny's potatoes.
OL,12,FEmily Torode joined 84 other
OL,13,Fcompetitors for the "backyard ultra
OL,14,Fmarathon" in which participants run
OL,15,Ffour miles (6.4km) every hour on the
OL,16,Fhour, returning to the start before the
OL,17,Fnext hour begins.
OL,19,FThe last runner to finish a loop when
OL,20,Feveryone else has dropped out, wins -
OL,21,Fwith Torode managing 26 laps.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
