OL,3,GNEWSA'I made race history - and
OL,4,Acelebrated with potato'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTorode, 34, whose parents hail from
OL,7,FGuernsey, said it was a "really nice
OL,8,Ffeeling" to have won and thanked her
OL,9,Fgranny Sylvia Torode for "supplying
OL,10,Fpotatoes" to fuel up on.
